responds to the `avx512*` and up target features for x86/x86_64."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" Internally this type may be viewed as:"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" * `i8x64` - sixty-four `i8` variables packed together"},{"DocComment":" * `i16x32` - thirty-two `i16` variables packed together"},{"DocComment":" * `i32x16` - sixteen `i32` variables packed together"},{"DocComment":" * `i64x8` - eight `i64` variables packed together"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" (as well as unsigned versions). Each intrinsic may interpret the"},{"DocComment":" internal bits differently, check the documentation of the intrinsic"},{"DocComment":" to see how it's being used."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" The in-memory representation of this type is the same as the one of an"},{"DocComment":" equivalent array (i.e. the in-memory order of elements is the same, and"},{"DocComment":" there is no padding); however, the alignment is different and equal to"},{"DocComment":" the size of the type. Note that the ABI for function calls may *not* be"},{"DocComment":" the same."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" Note that this means that an instance of `__m512i` typically just means"},{"DocComment":" a \"bag of bits\" which is left up to interpretation at the point of use."}],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":true},"is_local":false,"started_from":false,"is_extern":false,"opacity":"Foreign","lang_item":null,"diagnostic_item":null,"has_errors":false},"generics":{"regions":[],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_clauses":[],"outlives":[],"trait_type_constraints":[]},"src":"Normal","kind":"Opaque","layout":[{"key":"x86_64-apple-darwin","value":{"size":{"chosen":{"Value":[31,{"Constant":{"Value":[14,[{"Integer":{"Unsigned":["Usize","64"]}},{"Deduplicated":0}]]}}]},"guarantee":null},"align":{"chosen":{"Deduplicated":31},"guarantee":null},"discriminator":{"Known":0},"inhabited":{"Deduplicated":0},"variant_layouts":[{"field_offsets":[{"guarantee":null,"chosen":0}],"inhabited":{"Dedup